{"id": "DfKaReyz8is", "title": "Video by therishikatha", "description": "Why does Hanuman ji carry a whole mountain? Because Lakshman lay dying, and there was no time to search for one herb. 🙏\n\nलाय सजीवन लखन जियाये\nश्रीरघुबीर हरषि उर लाये\n\n(Laaye sajeevan Lakhan jiyaaye, Shri Raghubir harashi ur laaye: you brought the Sanjeevani and brought Lakshman back to life, and Ram, overjoyed, held you to his heart.)\n\nIn the Ramayan, Lakshman falls in battle, and the healer Sushena says only the Sanjeevani herb from the Himalaya can save him, before the sun rises. Hanuman ji flies through the night, but on the mountain he cannot tell which herb it is, so he lifts the whole peak and carries it back to Lanka in time.\n\nSave this for the days you need strength, and send it to someone who needs Sankat Mochan today.\n\nStories of Hanuman ji, Ram and the gods, written for kids: Rishi Katha books, Books 1–3 as a set for ₹500 at rishikatha.com (link in bio).\n\nFollow @therishikatha for more.\n\n#hanuman #hanumanji #jaishriram #bajrangbali #sankatmochan sanjeevani hanumanchalisa jaihanuman ramayan lakshman sanatandharma bhakti hindu devotional rishikatha", "channel": "therishikatha", "uploader_id": "22569163881", "uploader": "Rishi Katha", "timestamp": 1793458230, "like_count": 126, "comment_count": 1, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-2160525124595457a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 89.263, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr22-1.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQOgZGkFfebKrOQs8YtocSmpsVoir7IEyjr6DIjJsE7wo6QTGVsQPyYTCkseIKzdQPmjUKawsCKiPYFHYJ2Cbg5-fWg-_9ZK20rPcNw.mp4?_nc_cat=111&_nc_oc=AdrPK6xOVtvvE4JrzIJ1PjKPcoCFAOv63Oc0jSfyhyfR3Nwga4xr_cPVJA3fpIpMNHAzlz7zCKxXZknl3OeB7Ys2&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr22-1.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=TwkzoG90SyEQ7kNvwHziXZU&&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=Hk4wRcREXcrWePpv-gRR6Q&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bu